{"body": [{"y0": 67.6, "x0": 140.5, "x1": 253.7, "text": "GRAMMATICA LATINA"}, {"y0": 81.6, "x0": 141.4, "x1": 244.5, "text": "*Ut', (né cum coniünctivo"}, {"y0": 95.5, "x0": 141.0, "x1": 413.4, "text": "[A] Tempus praeséns. 205"}, {"y0": 109.4, "x0": 150.6, "x1": 394.8, "text": "Iulius Davo imperat ut puerum excitet. Aemilia Syram mo-"}, {"y0": 123.6, "x0": 140.3, "x1": 234.5, "text": "net né puellam excitet."}, {"y0": 137.4, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 395.0, "text": "Dàvus clàmat, ut puerum excitet. Syra tacet, ne puellam"}, {"y0": 151.5, "x0": 140.1, "x1": 168.9, "text": "excitet."}, {"y0": 165.3, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 414.6, "text": "Dàvus ita (tam clàre, tantà voce) clàmat ut puerum excitet. 210"}, {"y0": 178.8, "x0": 140.7, "x1": 318.9, "text": "Syra tam quieta est ut puellam nón excitet."}, {"y0": 193.1, "x0": 140.9, "x1": 244.9, "text": "[B] Tempus praeteritum."}, {"y0": 207.1, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 394.7, "text": "Iülius Davo imperàvit ut puerum excitàret. Aemilia Syram"}, {"y0": 221.1, "x0": 140.1, "x1": 259.3, "text": "monuit ne puellam excitaret."}, {"y0": 234.8, "x0": 150.2, "x1": 413.9, "text": "Dàvus clàmàvit, ut puerum excitàret. Syra tacebat, né puel- 215"}, {"y0": 248.7, "x0": 140.1, "x1": 195.4, "text": "lam excitàret."}, {"y0": 262.5, "x0": 150.2, "x1": 394.7, "text": "Davus ita clàmàvit ut puerum excitàret. Syra tam quiéta"}, {"y0": 276.6, "x0": 140.0, "x1": 261.6, "text": "erat ut puellam nón excitàret."}, {"y0": 304.3, "x0": 140.0, "x1": 193.2, "text": "PENSVM A"}, {"y0": 318.3, "x0": 139.8, "x1": 394.3, "text": "Magister pueros monet — pulchré scrib-. Sextus tam pulchré"}, {"y0": 332.4, "x0": 140.0, "x1": 394.1, "text": "scribit — magister eum laud-. Magister ipse calamum sümit,"}, {"y0": 346.1, "x0": 139.4, "x1": 212.5, "text": "— litteràás scrib-."}, {"y0": 358.7, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 394.3, "text": "Daedalus àlàs confécit — 6 labyrinthó évol-. Icarus tam"}, {"y0": 374.1, "x0": 139.8, "x1": 394.1, "text": "alte volàvit — soli appropinqu-, quamquam pater eum mo-"}, {"y0": 388.4, "x0": 139.8, "x1": 246.5, "text": "nuerat — temerárius es-."}, {"y0": 402.0, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 393.9, "text": "Heri Quintus arborem ascendit, — nidum quaer-, etsi pa-"}, {"y0": 415.9, "x0": 139.8, "x1": 393.9, "text": "ter eum monuerat — cautus es-. Medicus Quinto imperàvit"}, {"y0": 429.8, "x0": 139.2, "x1": 393.9, "text": "— oculós claud-, — cultrum medici vid-. Quintus tam palli-"}, {"y0": 444.0, "x0": 139.4, "x1": 317.6, "text": "dus erat — Syra eum mortuum esse put-."}, {"y0": 457.8, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 393.0, "text": "Sol ita làcébat — pastor umbram pet-, — in sóle ambul-."}, {"y0": 471.9, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 393.9, "text": "Tantus atque tàlis deus est Iuppiter — Optimus Màximus"}, {"y0": 485.7, "x0": 139.2, "x1": 177.0, "text": "appell—."}, {"y0": 499.4, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 393.9, "text": "Verba: vehere -isse -um; ponere -isse -um; àmittere -isse"}, {"y0": 513.3, "x0": 138.9, "x1": 393.6, "text": "—um; allicere —isse Cum; éripere —isse —um; secàre -isse -um;"}, {"y0": 526.8, "x0": 140.7, "x1": 393.6, "text": "suádére -isse; désilire —isse; canere —isse; crédere -isse;"}, {"y0": 541.5, "x0": 140.7, "x1": 282.9, "text": "confiteri —um esse; làbi -um esse."}], "margin": [{"y0": 132.8, "x0": 39.2, "x1": 117.3, "text": "- D. clàmat quia pue-"}, {"y0": 141.8, "x0": 44.0, "x1": 104.0, "text": "rum excitàre vult"}, {"y0": 150.8, "x0": 39.0, "x1": 120.9, "text": "— S. tacet quia puellam"}, {"y0": 159.9, "x0": 42.8, "x1": 101.3, "text": "excitáre nón vult"}, {"y0": 304.7, "x0": 39.5, "x1": 90.3, "text": "Vocabula nova:"}, {"y0": 313.7, "x0": 38.8, "x1": 63.3, "text": "fundus"}, {"y0": 323.4, "x0": 38.8, "x1": 51.4, "text": "vita"}, {"y0": 331.3, "x0": 38.8, "x1": 140.2, "text": "lucrum |"}, {"y0": 341.7, "x0": 38.8, "x1": 53.6, "text": "spés"}, {"y0": 349.3, "x0": 37.9, "x1": 139.8, "text": "divitiae |"}, {"y0": 359.4, "x0": 38.6, "x1": 62.6, "text": "lactüra"}, {"y0": 368.4, "x0": 38.8, "x1": 61.9, "text": "laetitia"}, {"y0": 376.8, "x0": 37.9, "x1": 140.2, "text": "tristitia |"}, {"y0": 386.0, "x0": 38.5, "x1": 140.2, "text": "návigàtió |"}, {"y0": 394.5, "x0": 38.5, "x1": 140.2, "text": "delphinus |"}, {"y0": 404.6, "x0": 38.5, "x1": 54.8, "text": "fides"}, {"y0": 412.8, "x0": 38.5, "x1": 140.2, "text": "fidicen |"}, {"y0": 424.5, "x0": 38.3, "x1": 60.8, "text": "cantus"}, {"y0": 434.1, "x0": 38.3, "x1": 64.4, "text": "carmen"}, {"y0": 440.4, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 140.2, "text": "dorsum |"}, {"y0": 450.5, "x0": 38.3, "x1": 77.7, "text": "maleficium"}, {"y0": 459.6, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 55.2, "text": "salüs"}, {"y0": 468.5, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 48.5, "text": "für"}, {"y0": 477.6, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 62.8, "text": "fürtum"}, {"y0": 485.9, "x0": 37.4, "x1": 77.7, "text": "beneficium"}, {"y0": 497.1, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 69.1, "text": "tyrannus"}, {"y0": 504.8, "x0": 37.9, "x1": 64.6, "text": "felicitàs"}, {"y0": 513.3, "x0": 37.0, "x1": 62.0, "text": "invidia"}, {"y0": 523.2, "x0": 37.7, "x1": 65.6, "text": "piscator"}, {"y0": 532.4, "x0": 37.7, "x1": 63.5, "text": "fortüna"}, {"y0": 542.3, "x0": 37.7, "x1": 59.3, "text": "rémus"}]}